# A remainder by 3 of ⌊k/2⌋ + (%tid.x & 31), k an enclosing loop's
# counter, is refused; in the loop nested in k's the reason names the
# floor as a counter, and in k's own loop the next variable.
RUN: %ptxroof analyze %fixtures/micro/counter_floor_reason.ptx | FileCheck --check-prefix=ANN "%s"
ANN: {{^}}	st.global.u32 	[%rd3], 1; // global store addr ? (depends on an enclosing loop's counter){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	st.global.u32 	[%rd3], 1; // [<block 3>] warp * × lane * | exec (64·max(param_1, 1))/CTA | global store addr ? (depends on special register (%tid.x mod 32), in a division){{$}}
